Spec: Local review console verification

Purpose:
  Exercise production workflow and receipt code using scripted terminal ports and private temporary databases.

Owns:
  ./ReviewConsoleTests.cs

Must:
  Remove newer connection journals when constructing older schema fixtures; migration must not invent flows or attachments.
  Remove newer access tables when constructing historical schema fixtures and verify the current schema version after migration.
  Verify explicit confirmation, stale snapshots, cancelled input, durable recovery, failed prepare/acknowledgement and no automatic replay.
  Cover receipt corruption, file lease contention, rendering injection, bounded paging and actual redirected executable refusal.
  Distinguish scripted-port verification from unexecuted native interactive owner testing.
